@startuml Notifications
title Notifications

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

== Viewing All Notifications ==
User -> App: Open notifications screen
App -> API: GET /api/notifications/
API -> DB: Fetch user's notifications
DB -> API: Return notification list
API -> App: Notification data
App -> User: Display notification list

== Viewing Alert Notifications ==
User -> App: Filter by "Alerts"
App -> API: GET /api/notifications/alerts/
API -> DB: Fetch alert-type notifications
DB -> API: Return alerts
API -> App: Alert notifications
App -> User: Display urgent warnings

== Viewing Reminders ==
User -> App: Filter by "Reminders"
App -> API: GET /api/notifications/reminders/
API -> DB: Fetch reminder notifications
DB -> API: Return reminders
API -> App: Reminder data
App -> User: Display tasks and schedules


@enduml
